Choices I made where the spec was open:
- **`Views`:** it increments atomically on every `GET /api/posts/{id}`. The spec only says the server maintains it, so this is my reading. `PUT` changes only the title, so it never touches `Views`. `Views` isn't in the JSON.
- **Deleting a blog:** its posts are deleted too.
- **Status codes:**
  - `POST` returns 201.
  - Unknown ids return 404.
  - A missing or blank `name` or `title` returns 400.
- **Not compiled or run:** I haven't built this or run it against the grader.
- **`using` directives:** `List<>` needs `using System.Collections.Generic;`. With implicit usings off, add it at the top of the file.

